{"id":2714,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>为引领青少年赓续红色血脉、筑牢信仰根基，5月22日下午，马克思主义学院研究生“知行宣讲团”走进太原市万柏林区第二中学，开展“百年团史薪火传，青春向党启新程”主题宣讲活动。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HU8lgDL87bL4lDnLm-PL4UDnz9DnzVM2ozvDMlC4L8-sMmU0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyPU1h7MkyaMmVkLzWRnzAfnRrfLmVfnm9YMzT2LlrVLNWFLRlYMlCiLNVFLmGDUzlJqjfTQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysLzligtA8pUocc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7155&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C1BD4061B12CE8AD5A21AF8259F1EE2B/0525F52A/206A5\" vheight=\"414.7300109863281\" vwidth=\"553.0700073242188\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HU8lgDL87bL4lDnLm-PL4UDnz9DnzVM2ozvDMlC4L8-sMmU0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyPU1h7MkyaMmVkLzWRnzAfnRrfLmVfnm9YMzT2LlrVLNWFLRlYMlCiLNVFLmGDUzlJqjfTQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysLzligtA8pUocc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7155&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>本次宣讲由宣讲团成员刘梦瑶主讲，她以共青团发展脉络为主线，围绕团的基础知识、百年光辉历程、团徽团旗荣光、时代使命召唤、青年榜样事迹、争做新时代青年六个维度层层展开，系统回顾共青团百年砥砺征程，生动讲述一代代青年紧跟党旗、奋勇前行的奋斗故事，深刻阐释新时代青年肩负的责任与使命。宣讲还深入解读了习近平总书记重要回信精神，号召在场学子牢记殷切嘱托、勇担时代重任，自觉向团组织靠拢，在勤学笃行中锤炼品格、增长才干，努力成长为有理想、敢担当、能吃苦、肯奋斗的新时代好青年。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HMzvg4MlQkM8Q7oLz7YM7-iMmlbM4VM7LNUbLlVRoz78LN70gihFp2hmCIa0LYyZMYyDMYhkMzC8M8WRUll4nNCYL4U8U8VVn7L4ozvZLlnFL4WfM4GsM7QFL47sn7UJqjfTQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysLzligtA8pUocc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7155&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/38767B5647BCAE3FF2344CAEDC39781D/32A7074F/317DD\" vheight=\"414.7300109863281\" vwidth=\"553.0700073242188\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HMzvg4MlQkM8Q7oLz7YM7-iMmlbM4VM7LNUbLlVRoz78LN70gihFp2hmCIa0LYyZMYyDMYhkMzC8M8WRUll4nNCYL4U8U8VVn7L4ozvZLlnFL4WfM4GsM7QFL47sn7UJqjfTQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysLzligtA8pUocc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7155&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>此次宣讲让同学们深切体悟了百年团史的峥嵘岁月，进一步涵养了同学们的家国情怀，希望同学们赓续红色血脉，传承奋斗精神，以昂扬姿态砥砺成长，将个人理想融入家国发展，用青春行动践行初心使命。</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HU8lgDL87bL4lDnLm-PL4UDnz9DnzVM2ozvDMlC4L8-sMmU0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyPU1h7MkyaMmVkLzWRnzAfnRrfLmVfnm9YMzT2LlrVLNWFLRlYMlCiLNVFLmGDUzlJqjfTQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysLzligtA8pUocc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7155&e=.jpeg"}